# Ignore arbitrary Markdown documentation, with exceptions for AI navigation
*.md
**/*.md
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!CONTEXT.md
!CONTEXT-MAP.md
!DESIGN.md
!**/context.md
!docs/**/*.md
!palmedex-kit/**/*.md

